---
import { RUKOS, waLink } from "../data/site";
import WhatsAppIcon from "./WhatsAppIcon.astro";
---

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-gray-900 pt-16">
  <img
    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460317442991-0ec209397118?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1800"
    alt=""
    class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 size-full object-cover opacity-40"
  />
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-gray-900 via-gray-900/60 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-24 sm:px-6 sm:py-32 lg:px-8 lg:py-40">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500/15 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-teal-300 ring-1 ring-teal-400/30">
        <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span>
        {RUKOS.length} unit ruko tersedia di Bogor
      </span>

      <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">
        Ruko strategis untuk <span class="text-teal-400">usaha yang berkembang</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg/relaxed text-pretty text-gray-300">
        Lokasi ramai, akses mudah, dan legalitas jelas. Pilih ruko yang sesuai kebutuhan Anda,
        lalu konsultasikan langsung via WhatsApp — gratis dan tanpa ribet.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="#ruko" class="rounded-lg bg-teal-500 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-teal-400">
          Lihat Pilihan Ruko
        </a>
        <a
          href={waLink()}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-white/10 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white ring-1 ring-white/20 transition hover:bg-white/20"
        >
          <WhatsAppIcon /> Tanya via WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
